  "records": [
    {
      "id": "i01",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "At each redshift, a photon budget can look open because galaxies leak too little ionizing light, or because model assumptions carry the mismatch.",
      "text_sha256": "21c5bc7630029e505cf2494506cf35075c9fa062b44351765c663451e27582cf",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/i01-21c5bc763002.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "6be67ed944c793904e9e18b87f8f29c4f7b617125e1e3c7dd877482fcff8b82c",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.904000",
          "size": "142464"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i02",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "If galaxies were genuinely leaking too little ionizing radiation, that would limit how they could maintain reionization.",
      "text_sha256": "929edc737d53f6e101fd17ab8a20a7897638bc9e68b35f3437e25ebebf877df9",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/i02-929edc737d53.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "420fc5c729986bca75cbf50bcd867ca5fa523081282f0e0adda7d1851871cb44",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.888000",
          "size": "110208"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i03",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "But an apparent shortfall could instead be a fact about low-redshift proxy transport or another frozen assumption, not about the galaxies.",
      "text_sha256": "75d8a9c63aa196b09a106f881e1ea66664bd44e6db4a0cef56b98cb73e1ef921",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/i03-75d8a9c63aa1.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "969d8e19903b8f7997a9e93089d84f19bf63cf01d77309b02991c9bf00a183d5",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.440000",
          "size": "119040"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i04",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "How do we tell a source shortfall from an assumption shortfall?",
      "text_sha256": "600f27c384e1e08d29856aca391f1d9fb5b5bfdf4bd32db1da8a1c6a2dc77a29",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/i04-600f27c384e1.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "c67ca70556dae3f64e62a772393be3482338cb9fe336715c475e2f29e43e7ba8",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "3.576000",
          "size": "57216"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d01",
      "section": "difficulty",
      "text": "One redshift cannot settle that question, because required and inferred escape fractions each carry an uncertainty structure that can overlap or separate.",
      "text_sha256": "c365bd74055d68570c062a83f24cd76ed3f3609180007e17c365c8ca95e350be",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/d01-c365bd74055d.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "ed8e97481d0c6652bd24e19e30956eac24dc39235bcb345685cd485a956641d8",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.232000",
          "size": "131712"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d02",
      "section": "difficulty",
      "text": "The method must ask how the full envelopes behave across redshift and how that comparison changes when the assumptions are challenged.",
      "text_sha256": "5e79da216342501e8f1835c3591a3a9d6e26704bfddfddead7e5d4c24238a098",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/d02-5e79da216342.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "5672e15061e8303f7444d56967935f0d526130795d7357079e7f321821b7fea8",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.720000",
          "size": "107520"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p01",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "The discriminating move is a redshift sweep that computes the required and proxy-inferred escape-fraction envelopes under the same declared prior draws.",
      "text_sha256": "c75aebe210dcc9f69486edd7ba1a7cd76d9ec46d5828d83947cf75100424ab55",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/p01-c75aebe210dc.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "30de228315dc00b13993133a85604a4b8143129614241cd437e8b2d8bea461ab",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "9.096000",
          "size": "145536"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p02",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "At every grid position, the required side propagates recombination, ionizing-efficiency, clumping, and source-density assumptions as one auditable calculation.",
      "text_sha256": "0cf94b59cc6051a761a1aaa2c6a422465338cf4a4f87a7e272b5e3f4d5fa0cdc",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/p02-0cf94b59cc60.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "209850759ad3026f00bcb280ca88fedf8943435feba9917e881c85269e77cb3b",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "10.176000",
          "size": "162816"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "The inferred side transports both proxy calibrations through the identical sweep so calibration choice and calibration transport remain separable questions.",
      "text_sha256": "de80768a0fb689c74ec662b8ea4d931d382e18b8865a7b8ed086036daeef2f43",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/p03-de80768a0fb6.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "8517ba33c8dc4ac335e8f8e158284b63e861cbb7d90a303d7ccdf1e781939f49",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.904000",
          "size": "142464"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p04",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "Then the sweep is rerun under a challenged source-density prior, while a separate boundary keeps proxy evolution outside the modeled envelope.",
      "text_sha256": "c7efcdeb486f9bc39fcf741ac41680c4ff8aa1a3717cb0a4c2e5c346ae20a55b",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/p04-c7efcdeb486f.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "85e4e74abb0230dc51dea2f1278731c76b1f273dd37548c72b0085cfd5702f0d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.968000",
          "size": "127488"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p05",
      "section": "peak",
      "text": "Only that paired response can distinguish a mismatch stable within the declared model from one that depends on an untested transport assumption.",
      "text_sha256": "3627da301b5670668f45469bd3d19d532ec5c6f9e00953b2bfb4e2f84f4b8ae8",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/p05-3627da301b56.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f800007d8465c869acbdfd8df622b0ba5d329fce39670788e510ff807c99b20a",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.848000",
          "size": "125568"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f01",
      "section": "sample",
      "text": "The source ledger is a sequence of model inputs, redshift positions, prior draws, and scenario reruns, with the scientific outputs omitted here.",
      "text_sha256": "fdd84b9c38f7be3efc53e8f29b5f12c6bd013a95a4cbd1d7e73a81ee3e18eebf",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/f01-fdd84b9c38f7.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "e9c1cd27184b665240b042c6ad912e147ba1368f67ceee33a39fb46f5d0f8f4c",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.448000",
          "size": "135168"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f02",
      "section": "sample",
      "text": "Because no sibling source freeze exists, this canary carries the pipeline stages but drops every result count, threshold, and curve value.",
      "text_sha256": "926f855df1bb676594173279288194b64f4cf853b2ca6d9549dd216f3087c603",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/f02-926f855df1bb.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "32cd687076376a81c028886835a0ec5de0649a46aea0f8db77c84865cfba611f",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.160000",
          "size": "130560"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e01",
      "section": "estimator",
      "text": "The estimator is the required escape fraction minus the proxy-inferred escape fraction at each redshift, shown symbolically without a value or sign.",
      "text_sha256": "d5ae29ca4e5be28b9856d7306124e966e70d7996b917f189d03880f554da3f42",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/e01-d5ae29ca4e5b.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "e2283f4f3f9416dc3e6346f7a5167c64e5bf841ea946766400ce956652673bec",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "9.168000",
          "size": "146688"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e02",
      "section": "estimator",
      "text": "Its uncertainty is the propagated systematic envelope from matched prior draws, not a measurement error and not a probability about the sky.",
      "text_sha256": "e1d63131a6983f42d28b121975e018f1103088f56d01a01680afd51008c60bd2",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/e02-e1d63131a698.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "7cac4744dfaf10cd066ccb9497233af679a21dc52b1947373dede1a9f60c606e",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.944000",
          "size": "127104"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c01",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "The dual-proxy arms test calibration choice, while the source-density corner tests whether a coupled prior drives the comparison.",
      "text_sha256": "36a5db2609f238f073dbd8bd73801cd13fb27b56e1c9134b896df6b3c4eeaa97",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/c01-36a5db2609f2.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "40dc5a7a635abca6ac25c6cac950cdac8d8b8a8a40e3a098ae23b417aa7b3071",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.056000",
          "size": "112896"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c02",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "Proxy-transport evolution is kept as an external challenge, because changing both inference arms together cannot be detected by agreement between them.",
      "text_sha256": "f3489fa40dec9c0aca52211dc03d66f24886dc2219139f4ad11503a3d106905e",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/c02-f3489fa40dec.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "148cefbe0cc1e2230a1d1ff421fd2ac83008f34af1bf7adcd4700b60ac69459a",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.880000",
          "size": "142080"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g01",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "We tied our own hands by freezing the anchors, grid, estimator, and systematic corners before inspecting any crossing or trend.",
      "text_sha256": "da4aab1b1f6b43cb2406744323653fb274fd4068593b48d2f0275f8720b798b0",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/g01-da4aab1b1f6b.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "855922abb67ffd454f3665c671627ede41f741e00dccbd414f3019b8bef2ef3d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.296000",
          "size": "116736"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g02",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "The gates are scientific discipline: one grid position cannot be promoted after the fact, and an external systematic cannot be smuggled into the envelope.",
      "text_sha256": "08c3efe5ac49757c80cfa4180fc503e88e368475e3a027c8d3fc52e138e45bb7",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/g02-08c3efe5ac49.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f51c7d5c3445d6053a917ac7f14cf4f16a0eb6c052133d48457573b76ece08ea",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "7.512000",
          "size": "120192"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b01",
      "section": "boundary",
      "text": "What is known is the formalism and test design; curve values, crossings, signs, and any statement about real galaxies remain outside this canary.",
      "text_sha256": "b65ae5f8a2879ce5e6e55e1f74c1f6ca50c0e8721b266221bbb5b298207840da",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/b01-b65ae5f8a287.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "3fc0d87e29cee5838441b6c6f28bff7db9702bdf106cf1168a5d7ef265777f52",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "8.880000",
          "size": "142080"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "x01",
      "section": "payoff",
      "text": "Ask the opening question again: would a mismatch belong to the galaxies, or to the assumptions transported into the budget?",
      "text_sha256": "02735299012347d9e4c7cf638d1fec6dbf3409595a19146bfe04a94f33e94694",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/x01-027352990123.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "af1049d4fffbdd1c58e203b43246593e4b232d6b6edce6ab3d7ef80e4eff9ea6",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.576000",
          "size": "105216"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "x02",
      "section": "payoff",
      "text": "Now we have a test that can separate those explanations without asserting which one the unfrozen evidence supports.",
      "text_sha256": "0aedad8443ab72b3d8594351582af391725b76d837ae47cf5a9a31f4c90ae0c8",
      "file": "audio/fesc/raw/x02-0aedad8443ab.mp3",
